  Status: ready for bounded audit/authoring upon parent claim release in
  issue26; dependencies remain explicit. Coordinator: @hairer. Live issue:
  <hlink|#44|https://github.com/hairer/humanise-yang-mills/issues/44>. Use
  the frozen snapshot and parent release linked from the handoff index.

  <section|Result><label|result>

  Audit and complete the assigned existing chapters as a coherent part of the
  Lean-following monograph. This includes repairing real proof gaps within
  these files and making same-data handoffs explicit, not just listing
  declarations. Preserve the source's main mathematical steps.

