  Also read the relevant sections of the parent correspondence and current
  review logs. Start Lean inspection at the fully qualified declarations in
  those records and their meaning-determining definitions, at source revision
  <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>. Expand only as
  required to resolve a specific input or discrepancy. The source anchor map
  is evidence, not a substitute for checking the theorem statement. Reuse
  canonical proofs and verified references before writing a new derivation.

  <section|Dependencies, review and acceptance><label|dependencies-review-and-acceptance>

  The other coverage packages can work in parallel on disjoint files. For
  each cross-package edge, record the exact statement, producer label, common
  objects, normalization, quantifiers and current status. A draft or
  undelivered producer may remain an explicit input, but the consumer is not
  marked globally closed. Use the common contract and agent prompt in this
  directory. Produce a focused PR, actual checks and a final-hash handoff. A
  different agent must independently review both mathematics and Lean
  correspondence; authors cannot approve their own repairs. Do not mark
  completion from a clean build or a local agent pass.

  A bounded C03 refresh added <verbatim|ex-phase-original-null> to
  phase-regularity and updated the phase-fields application; both are in the
  existing owned file set. Read <verbatim|phase-null-inheritance-evidence.md>
  and the latest reviewer closure entries for same-trial spanning and
  preservation of all separated correlations.

